# ============================================================
# Temporary Agent Reports (auto-generated, should not be committed)
# Case-insensitive patterns for agent-generated reports
# Exceptions for docs/audit/ and docs/maintenance/ track legitimate reports
# ============================================================
*[Bb][Rr][Oo][Cc][Uu][Ll][Aa]*[Aa][Uu][Dd][Ii][Tt]*.md
*[Bb][Rr][Oo][Cc][Uu][Ll][Aa]*[Vv][Ee][Rr][Ii][Ff][Ii][Cc][Aa][Tt][Ii][Oo][Nn]*.md
*[Bb][Rr][Oo][Cc][Uu][Ll][Aa]*[Ss][Cc][Aa][Nn]*[Rr][Ee][Pp][Oo][Rr][Tt]*.md
*[Cc][Oo][Dd][Ee][Bb][Aa][Ss][Ee]*[Hh][Ee][Aa][Ll][Tt][Hh]*[Cc][Hh][Ee][Cc][Kk]*.md
*[Rr][Ee][Pp][Oo][Kk][Ee][Ee][Pp][Ee][Rr]*[Mm][Aa][Ii][Nn][Tt][Ee][Nn][Aa][Nn][Cc][Ee]*.md
*[Mm][Aa][Ii][Nn][Tt][Ee][Nn][Aa][Nn][Cc][Ee]*[Rr][Ee][Pp][Oo][Rr][Tt]*.md
*[Aa][Uu][Dd][Ii][Tt]*[Rr][Ee][Pp][Oo][Rr][Tt]*.md
*[Hh][Ee][Aa][Ll][Tt][Hh]*[Cc][Hh][Ee][Cc][Kk]*.md
*[Hh][Ee][Aa][Ll][Tt][Hh]*[Rr][Ee][Pp][Oo][Rr][Tt]*.md
*[Bb][Uu][Gg]*[Ss][Cc][Aa][Nn]*[Rr][Ee][Pp][Oo][Rr][Tt]*.md

# Exceptions for tracked directories
!docs/audit/
!docs/audit/BROCULA-AUDIT-*.md
!docs/maintenance/
!docs/maintenance/*.md
!docs/maintenance/archive/
!docs/maintenance/archive/*

# Ignore directories for reports that are not tracked
docs/audits/
docs/reports/
docs/stale-branches-report.md
